For those of you with Windows95/NT and who are interested in a window
front-end to the parser, I have a rough-cut of such at
http://www.dimensional.com/~thanatos/

I'd describe it as "functional," but it does make the tree output of the
parser more intelligible, and also helps with comparative sentence
structure.

There's no documentation as of yet, but it only does one thing. :)
You type in the place you can type, and push the strange button to
generate the tree.

